        "apparel": {
            "description": "A sleek, masculine black nylon streetwear bomber jacket, partially zipped, showing clean lines and heavyweight fabric texture."
        }
    },
    "background_environment": {
        "ceiling": "Rustic dark woodpanel ceiling with exposed beams, illuminated by a deep red and magenta ambient glow.",
        "decorations": "A vertical strand of warm orange fairy lights behind the subjects, rendering as soft, glowing golden bokeh circles.",
        "depth": "Shallow depth of field with heavily blurred background details, framing the two subjects in sharp focus."
    },
    "optimized_generation_prompt": "A raw, highfidelity photo flash snapshot of two young men posing confidently sidebyside in a rustic room. On the left, a shirtless young man with a highly muscular sixpack torso, messy dark brown wavy curls, and striking bluegreen eyes poses with his arm around his partner. On the right, a young man with textured, dyed platinumwhite hair and a clean undercut fade looks directly into the camera with a cool, confident, relaxed masculine expression and a neutral mouth.. Capturing a dynamic freezeframe snapshot aesthetic with an intense overexposed camera flash, sharp shadows cast on the dark background, and a warm magenta ambient glow on the wooden beamed ceiling. Hyperrealistic skin textures, shallow depth of field, 35mm lens style."
}",
